      "question": "Which versioned persistence format, storage location, and atomic write and recovery boundary apply?",
      "answer": "Versioned canonical human-readable JSON artifacts are stored below evidence/workflow/<workflow-id> and bind schema version, stable ID, revision, and SHA-256. Writers use same-directory temporary files, validation, atomic replacement, and receipt-last publication. Recovery uses only the last fully validated hash-bound receipt; a database may only be a derived index.",
