    },
    {
      "id": "IAD802",
      "status": "Answered",
      "question": "Which signature or attestation method, trust-root boundary, and fail-closed validation apply?",
      "answer": "Receipts and knowledge packages use a versioned standard attestation envelope with a detached signature over the canonical SHA-256 content hash. A separate versioned trust policy allowlists the signature profile, key ID, and trust roots. Missing or invalid signatures, unknown trust, hash drift, and expired policy fail closed.",
      "evidence": "Thorsten explicitly confirmed option A for IRQ802 on 2026-08-07; the IR802-IR806 repair preserves it unchanged."
    },
