      "id": "IAD803",
      "status": "Answered",
      "question": "Which retention, archival, deletion, and legal-hold rules apply per evidence class?",
      "answer": "Governance, decision, and completion receipts remain for the project lifetime and are archived when superseded. Operational execution evidence expires 90 days after completion; security and failure evidence expires after twelve months. Legal hold suspends deletion, every deletion creates a receipt, and secrets or unnecessary personal data are not stored.",
      "evidence": "Thorsten explicitly confirmed adjusted option A for IRQ803 on 2026-08-07; the IR802-IR806 repair preserves 90-day operational and twelve-month security and failure retention unchanged."
